                "content": "```\nInput: k = 2, prices = [3,2,6,5,0,3]\nOutput: 7\n```\n**Explanation:** Buy on day 2 (price = 2) and sell on day 3 (price = 6), profit = 6-2 = 4. Then buy on day 5 (price = 0) and sell on day 6 (price = 3), profit = 3-0 = 3. Total profit is 4 + 3 = 7."
